# Node profile loader for the MiniMax-DGX-Spark package.
#
# Concept: "nodes" = the machines involved. This package runs ComfyUI (and
# optionally an LLM tenant) on DGX-Spark hardware, but it is NOT hardcoded to
# a specific host topology. Source exactly ONE node profile before running
# the scripts; it defines the machine layout via ENV with sane defaults.

# ---- DEFAULT: single-node (everything on one machine) ----
# Everything (ComfyUI, models, output) on the current/local machine.
NODE_IP="${NODE_IP:-127.0.0.1}"
COMFY_PORT="${COMFY_PORT:-8188}"
COMFY_HOST="http://${NODE_IP}:${COMFY_PORT}"
COMFY_DIR="${COMFY_DIR:-${REPO_DIR:-.}/ComfyUI}"
COMFY_OUTPUT_DIR="${COMFY_OUTPUT_DIR:-$COMFY_DIR/output}"
PYTHON_BIN="${PYTHON_BIN:-python3}"
MODEL_ROOT="${MODEL_ROOT:-$COMFY_DIR/models}"

# ---- optional: dual-node / remote co-tenancy ----
# Example (used by default profile when you set these):
#   LLM_NODE_IP / COMFY_NODE_IP point at different machines.
#   A co-tenant LLM (e.g. DeepSeek) may run on its own node sharing UMA.
# EXTRA_FLAGS are ComfyUI launch flags for shared unified memory:
#   --disable-pinned-memory --disable-smart-memory --disable-cuda-malloc
HOST="${HOST:-0.0.0.0}"
EXTRA_FLAGS="${EXTRA_FLAGS:---disable-pinned-memory}"
